    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8186" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">circum -fŏdĭo</span></b> , no <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>perf.</i>, fossum,
			ĕre (<i>inf. pass.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">circumfodiri,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					5, 9, 12</span></i>
			; cf. fodio), v. n. and <i>a.</i>,
				<i>to dig around something</i>, <i>dig about</i> (agricultural t. t.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(a).</b>
			<i>Neutr.</i>, <i><span class="en">Cato, R. R.
			161</span></i>. 4.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(b).</b>
			<i>Act.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">truncum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					5, 6, 17</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">platanos,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen.
					Ep 12, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">arbores,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					17, 26, 39, § 248</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">plantas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Pall. Febr. 20, 2</span></i>
			.—<i>Inf. pass.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">circumfodi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Pall. Mart. 10, 19</span></i>
			.—<i>Part. perf. pass.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">circumfosso stipite,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					17, 27, 43, § 252</span></i>
			.</div>
